The Z-matrix for the fep calculation needs to be called gaszmat.
Then, to execute an entire fep calculation in the gas phase, just enter
csh fepgascmd >& log &

See xFEPGAS for easy execution of a single gas-phase fep
calculation in any directory. Uses 10 windows, delta lambda = 0.05

xFEPGAS25 uses 25 windows, delta lambda = 0.02
xFEPGAS25Q is the queue version.
